  "notes": [
    "cliff_kind is a prespecified diagnostic category. 'stereochemical' and 'fingerprint_blind' pairs are indistinguishable to an ECFP4-equivalent ligand representation, so metrics must be reported per kind rather than pooled.",
    "Cliff magnitude is endpoint-specific: max(1.0, 2 * sigma_rep). A flat 1 p-unit threshold would sit inside measurement noise for pKd (sigma_rep 0.945).",
    "Both members share one comparability group (tier 1). BindingDB has no assay identifier, so that is the tightest available proxy, and the panel is small as a result.",
